---@class posthog.autoresearch.CreateAutoresearchTrainingRunsIterationRequest
---@field project_id string Project ID of the project you're trying to access. To find the ID of the project, make a call to /api/projects/.
---@field pipeline_id string
---@field id string A UUID string identifying this autoresearch training run.
---@field iteration_number number Zero-based index of this iteration within the run. Re-sending the same number updates that iteration (idempotent).
---@field recipe_snapshot posthog.autoresearch.CreateAutoresearchTrainingRunsIterationRequestRecipeSnapshot Compact recipe for this iteration: feature_sql (HogQL SELECT keyed on person_id) and transforms.
