---@field status posthog.autoresearch.RecordIterationStatusEnum|string 'kept' if this iteration improved on the best score, 'discarded' otherwise, 'crashed' on failure. * `kept` - kept * `discarded` - discarded * `crashed` - crashed
---@field train_score? number|distilled.Null Training-set AUC for this iteration (0-1).
---@field holdout_score? number|distilled.Null Held-out AUC for this iteration (0-1). Used to pick the champion at completion.
---@field agent_description? string Agent's plain-English rationale for this iteration. Max 2000 characters.
---@field summary? string|distilled.Null One plain sentence for people on what this experiment tried and what happened. Max 300 characters.
---@field headline? string|distilled.Null A short title for people, at most 60 characters, on what this experiment tried. Use plain words, with no column names, SQL or model jargon. Longer text is cut, not rejected.
---@field agent_confidence? number|distilled.Null Agent's self-assessed confidence (0-1) that this iteration helps.
---@field parent_suggestion? string|distilled.Null UUID of the steering suggestion this iteration was spawned from, if any. Set it whenever the iteration acts on a pending suggestion — it links the iteration back to the suggestion for attribution and advances the suggestion to 'acted_on'.

