---@field resolved_activity_event string|distilled.Null Activity event found in your event schema, populated only for templates that auto-resolve the target ('likely_active_soon', 'at_risk_of_inactivity', 'return_after_first_use'). Null for templates where you supply target_event directly.
---@field activity_event_alternatives posthog.autoresearch.ResolvedTemplateActivityEventAlternativesList Other viable activity events found in your schema. If the resolved event is not the right signal, re-resolve with one of these as target_event.
