---Archive a pipeline
---
---Soft-delete a pipeline. Stops daily scoring and training. Predictions and metrics are preserved. When write_person_property is on, a cleanup run removes output_person_property from the people it scored. Refused while a training run is in progress.
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/autoresearch/{id}/archive/`
---Errors: BadRequest, NotFound.
---@param input posthog.autoresearch.AutoresearchArchiveCreateRequest
---@return posthog.autoresearch.AutoresearchPipeline? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:autoresearch_archive_create(input) end

---Manage autoresearch prediction pipelines.
---
---A pipeline defines a target event, population, and horizon. The autoresearch
---training loop finds the best predictive recipe; the inference workflow scores
---users daily and emits autoresearch_prediction events.
---
---`DELETE /api/projects/{project_id}/autoresearch/{id}/`
---Errors: BadRequest, NotFound.
---@param input posthog.autoresearch.AutoresearchDestroyRequest
---@return posthog.autoresearch.AutoresearchDestroyResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:autoresearch_destroy(input) end

---Resume a pipeline
---
---Resume a paused pipeline. Daily scoring and training will restart on the next cadence tick. Refused when the project already has its limit of live pipelines, which the limits endpoint reports.
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/autoresearch/{id}/resume/`
---Errors: BadRequest, NotFound.
---@param input posthog.autoresearch.AutoresearchResumeCreateRequest
---@return posthog.autoresearch.AutoresearchPipeline? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:autoresearch_resume_create(input) end

---Delete an artifact bundle file
---
---Remove one file from this training run's artifact bundle. Idempotent — deleting a missing file is a no-op. The bundle is frozen once the run completes or fails.
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/autoresearch/{pipeline_id}/training_runs/{id}/artifacts/delete/`
---Errors: BadRequest.
---@param input posthog.autoresearch.AutoresearchTrainingRunsArtifactsDeleteCreateRequest
---@return posthog.autoresearch.ArtifactDeleteResult? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:autoresearch_training_runs_artifacts_delete_create(input) end

---Get an artifact bundle file
---
---Fetch one file from this training run's artifact bundle, base64-encoded.
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/autoresearch/{pipeline_id}/training_runs/{id}/artifacts/get/`
---Errors: NotFound.
---@param input posthog.autoresearch.AutoresearchTrainingRunsArtifactsGetCreateRequest
---@return posthog.autoresearch.ArtifactContent? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:autoresearch_training_runs_artifacts_get_create(input) end

---Upload an artifact bundle file
---
---Upload one file of this training run's artifact bundle. Send the file contents base64-encoded in content_base64. Re-uploading the same path overwrites it. Use this — not curl/set_output — to author train.py, predict.py, and features.sql. The bundle is frozen once the run completes or fails.
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/autoresearch/{pipeline_id}/training_runs/{id}/artifacts/upload/`
---Errors: BadRequest.
---@param input posthog.autoresearch.AutoresearchTrainingRunsArtifactsUploadCreateRequest
---@return posthog.autoresearch.StoredArtifact? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:autoresearch_training_runs_artifacts_upload_create(input) end

---Validate a pipeline definition
---
---Validate a proposed pipeline's target event and population before creating it. Returns volume estimates, base rate, and any warnings. Creation does not enforce the result: 'horizon_exceeds_lookback' and an 'error' 'population_too_large' mean a run would fail, and the other 'error' codes mean the data is too thin for a reliable model. Call this before autoresearch-create.
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/autoresearch/validate/`
---@param input posthog.autoresearch.AutoresearchValidateCreateRequest
---@return posthog.autoresearch.ValidatePipelineResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:autoresearch_validate_create(input) end

---Run online validation
---
---Validate predictions against realized outcomes for all matured prediction dates. A prediction date is matured when today >= prediction_date + horizon_days. Computes realized AUC, Brier score, calibration error (ECE), and lift@10/20 per model. Updates the model's realized_score, calibration_error, and clears the is_preliminary flag. Already-validated dates are skipped. In production this is triggered by the daily Temporal validation workflow after inference runs.
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/autoresearch/{id}/validate_online/`
---Errors: BadRequest, NotFound.
---@param input posthog.autoresearch.AutoresearchValidateOnlineCreateRequest
---@return posthog.autoresearch.AutoresearchValidateOnlineCreateResponseBodyList? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:autoresearch_validate_online_create(input) end

---Manage autoresearch prediction pipelines.
---
---A pipeline defines a target event, population, and horizon. The autoresearch
---training loop finds the best predictive recipe; the inference workflow scores
---users daily and emits autoresearch_prediction events.
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/autoresearch/`
---@param input posthog.autoresearch.CreateAutoresearchRequest
---@return posthog.autoresearch.AutoresearchPipeline? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:create_autoresearch(input) end

---Pause a pipeline
---
---Pause daily scoring and training on a running pipeline. The pipeline can be resumed later. A training run already in progress finishes and can promote a new champion, but the pipeline stays paused and scores nobody until it is resumed.
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/autoresearch/{id}/pause/`
---Errors: BadRequest, NotFound.
---@param input posthog.autoresearch.CreateAutoresearchPauseRequest
---@return posthog.autoresearch.AutoresearchPipeline? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:create_autoresearch_pause(input) end

---Resolve a template
---
---Resolve a template key and optional overrides into a concrete pipeline config. For activity-based templates ('likely_active_soon', 'at_risk_of_inactivity', 'return_after_first_use'), the target event is auto-resolved from your event schema — check resolved_activity_event and activity_event_alternatives, then override if needed. For 'feature_adoption' and 'repeat_key_behavior', supply target_event. After resolving, call autoresearch-validate-create to check volume and warnings, then autoresearch-create to create the pipeline.
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/autoresearch/resolve-template/`
---Errors: BadRequest.
---@param input posthog.autoresearch.CreateAutoresearchResolveTemplateRequest
---@return posthog.autoresearch.ResolvedTemplate? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:create_autoresearch_resolve_template(input) end

---Run inference (score users)
---
---Start scoring the inference population using the champion model. Scoring runs in the background: it emits autoresearch_prediction events for each scored user and sets the pipeline's output_person_property on each scored person. The response returns at once with the running run. A second request while a run is running returns that run and starts nothing. The daily Temporal inference workflow also scores each pipeline on its cadence.
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/autoresearch/{id}/score/`
---Errors: BadRequest, NotFound.
---@param input posthog.autoresearch.CreateAutoresearchScoreRequest
---@return posthog.autoresearch.AutoresearchRun? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:create_autoresearch_score(input) end

---Submit a suggestion
---
---Inject a free-text hypothesis or direction into a running pipeline. The sandbox agent reads queued suggestions at the start of each iteration batch and decides: translate into a concrete iteration ('acted_on'), apply as a search constraint ('picked_up'), or reject with rationale ('dismissed'). Use priority='try_next' to instruct the agent to act on this before autonomous iterations; 'consider' is advisory. Check 'agent_response' after the next training run to see how the suggestion was interpreted.
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/autoresearch/{pipeline_id}/suggestions/`
---@param input posthog.autoresearch.CreateAutoresearchSuggestionRequest
---@return posthog.autoresearch.AutoresearchSuggestion? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:create_autoresearch_suggestion(input) end

---Respond to a suggestion
---
---Record how the agent handled a steering suggestion: set status to 'picked_up' (applied as a search constraint), 'acted_on' (spawned iterations), or 'dismissed' (rejected — explain in agent_response), and write the agent_response note the human will read. Call this from the training loop after deciding what to do with a pending suggestion. Recording an iteration with parent_suggestion set already advances a suggestion to 'acted_on'; use this to add the narrative or to mark a suggestion picked_up/dismissed without spawning an iteration. A suggestion only moves forward (queued, picked_up, then acted_on or dismissed); the same status again updates the note.
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/autoresearch/{pipeline_id}/suggestions/{id}/respond/`
---Errors: BadRequest.
---@param input posthog.autoresearch.CreateAutoresearchSuggestionsRespondRequest
---@return posthog.autoresearch.AutoresearchSuggestion? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:create_autoresearch_suggestions_respond(input) end

---Start a training run
---
---Start an asynchronous training run for this pipeline. Creates a Task/TaskRun sandbox where the autoresearch agent iterates on features and models, and returns the run immediately with status 'running'. Poll the training run until it reaches a terminal status (completed or failed). A pipeline's first run has no champion until it completes and promotion runs; on a retrain the existing champion stays live and keeps scoring until a new one is promoted.
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/autoresearch/{id}/train/`
---Errors: BadRequest, Forbidden, NotFound.
---@param input posthog.autoresearch.CreateAutoresearchTrainRequest
---@return posthog.autoresearch.AutoresearchTrainingRun? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:create_autoresearch_train(input) end

---Open a training run
---
---Open a new training run for a pipeline and return its id. An agent — the in-house sandbox, an external bring-your-own agent, or a scheduled job — then records iterations against this run and finalizes it with the complete endpoint. The run starts in 'running'.
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/autoresearch/{pipeline_id}/training_runs/`
---Errors: BadRequest.
---@param input posthog.autoresearch.CreateAutoresearchTrainingRunRequest
---@return posthog.autoresearch.AutoresearchTrainingRun? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:create_autoresearch_training_run(input) end

---Complete a training run
---
---Finalize a training run. The backend selects the kept iteration with the highest holdout score, decides champion vs challenger via the promotion ladder, and persists the model. best_iteration_id is advisory: it breaks a tie at the top score and is otherwise logged and ignored. Agents cannot set the champion directly, because promotion is server-side.
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/autoresearch/{pipeline_id}/training_runs/{id}/complete/`
---Errors: BadRequest.
---@param input posthog.autoresearch.CreateAutoresearchTrainingRunsCompleteRequest
---@return posthog.autoresearch.AutoresearchTrainingRun? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:create_autoresearch_training_runs_complete(input) end

---Record a training iteration
---
---Record one iteration of an open training run. Idempotent on iteration_number: re-sending the same number updates that iteration. A new iteration_number is refused once the run's iteration_budget is used. The recipe is validated server-side: feature_sql must be a read-only SELECT from {anchors} keyed on person_id, and model_class must be set. The class allowlist applies only at completion, to a run that uploaded no bundle.
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/autoresearch/{pipeline_id}/training_runs/{id}/iterations/`
---Errors: BadRequest.
---@param input posthog.autoresearch.CreateAutoresearchTrainingRunsIterationRequest
---@return posthog.autoresearch.AutoresearchIteration? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:create_autoresearch_training_runs_iteration(input) end

---Materialize training features to the sandbox
---
---Run features_sql server-side against the labeled training population and write the resulting train/holdout feature and label parquet files directly into this run's sandbox. Returns the local sandbox paths, row counts, and feature columns. The rows never pass through the agent's context and there is no 500-row cap. Read the returned paths with pd.read_parquet and iterate in Python.
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/autoresearch/{pipeline_id}/training_runs/{id}/materialize-features/`
---Errors: BadRequest.
---@param input posthog.autoresearch.CreateAutoresearchTrainingRunsMaterializeFeatureRequest
---@return posthog.autoresearch.MaterializeFeaturesResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:create_autoresearch_training_runs_materialize_feature(input) end

---Manage autoresearch prediction pipelines.
---
---A pipeline defines a target event, population, and horizon. The autoresearch
---training loop finds the best predictive recipe; the inference workflow scores
---users daily and emits autoresearch_prediction events.
---
---`GET /api/projects/{project_id}/autoresearch/{id}/`
---@param input posthog.autoresearch.GetAutoresearchRequest
---@return posthog.autoresearch.AutoresearchPipeline? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_autoresearch(input) end

---List training agent models
---
---Return the models a pipeline's training agent may run on, with the reasoning efforts each supports and its relative token cost, plus the model and effort a pipeline with blank settings uses. Pass a model id as agent_model and an effort as agent_reasoning_effort on create or update.
---
---`GET /api/projects/{project_id}/autoresearch/agent_models/`
---@param input posthog.autoresearch.GetAutoresearchAgentModelRequest
---@return posthog.autoresearch.AgentModelOptions? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_autoresearch_agent_model(input) end

---Read the project's limits
---
---Return the project's autoresearch limits and how much of each it is using: sandbox training runs in the last 24 hours against the daily limit, with when the next run can start at the limit, the most experiments per training run, and live pipelines against the live pipeline limit. Read-only; it runs no queries.
---
---`GET /api/projects/{project_id}/autoresearch/limits/`
---@param input posthog.autoresearch.GetAutoresearchLimitRequest
---@return posthog.autoresearch.ProjectLimits? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_autoresearch_limit(input) end

---List and retrieve champion/challenger models for a pipeline.
---
---Models are the persisted artifacts produced by training runs. Each model
---holds a portable recipe (feature SQL, transforms, model class, params) that
---the daily inference workflow compiles to score users.
---
---`GET /api/projects/{project_id}/autoresearch/{pipeline_id}/models/{id}/`
---@param input posthog.autoresearch.GetAutoresearchModelRequest
---@return posthog.autoresearch.AutoresearchModel? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_autoresearch_model(input) end

---Read realized performance history
---
---Return the realized metrics online validation recorded for each model on each validated prediction date, newest date first. Each row has realized AUC with a 95% interval, Brier score, calibration error, quantile calibration bins, mean predicted probability against the base rate, lift, and the model's role when it emitted and now. The rows come from the validation runs, so a former champion that a promotion archived keeps its history. Read-only; it runs no queries.
---
---`GET /api/projects/{project_id}/autoresearch/{id}/online_performance/`
---Errors: NotFound.
---@param input posthog.autoresearch.GetAutoresearchOnlinePerformanceRequest
---@return posthog.autoresearch.OnlinePerformance? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_autoresearch_online_performance(input) end

---List and retrieve inference and validation runs for a pipeline.
